        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#A6491F;color:#fff;font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">2</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#2A2724;margin:0 0 10px;">Written estimate</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">You get a free written quote priced per foot, with materials, clearing and gates spelled out. No surprises on the invoice.</p>
