<!-- AREAS -->
<section style="padding:76px 24px 60px;background:#fff;">
  <div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <span class="kicker">Service Areas</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,36px);margin:0 0 16px;">Serving Central Texas</h2>
    <div class="rich" style="text-align:left;"><p>We build ranch fencing from our home base in Waco across McLennan, Bosque and Falls counties. That includes <a href="/fence-builder-china-spring/">China Spring</a>, <a href="/fence-builder-crawford/">Crawford</a>, <a href="/fence-builder-mcgregor/">McGregor</a>, <a href="/fence-builder-valley-mills/">Valley Mills</a>, <a href="/fence-builder-lorena/">Lorena</a> and <a href="/fence-builder-west/">West</a>, plus the ranches and small acreage places in between. If you're within about an hour of Waco, we'll come walk your fence line.</p></div>
